// Sum of kept winning labeled hammings strictly below the upper central value.
// An empty below-set returns -1, not 0. A below sum of 0 stays 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hbels ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hbels rank

IMPULSE hbels 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "bels" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
